{
  "uid": "litellm-gateway",
  "title": "LLM gateway (LiteLLM) — cost, speed, failures",
  "description": "ローカルの LLM ゲートウェイの稼働状況。左上から右下へ、費用・利用元・応答速度・失敗の順。数字はすべて実際に応答したモデル単位で、main / complex などの別名は「振り分けが効いたか」の確認に使う。",
  "tags": [
    "llm",
    "gateway",
    "litellm"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "直近24時間の費用",
      "description": "アラート 1 と同じ式。$5 を超えると DailyCostHigh が発火する。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(litellm_spend_metric_total[24h]))",
          "legendFormat": "24h"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 4
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "累計費用（過去90日）",
      "description": "過去90日の合計費用。90日より前の分は含まない。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(litellm_spend_metric_total[90d]))",
          "legendFormat": "累計"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 4
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "直近24時間のリクエスト数",
      "description": "成功リクエストのみ。失敗は「失敗の累計」「失敗率」を参照。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(litellm_deployment_success_responses_total[24h]))",
          "legendFormat": "成功"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "失敗の累計",
      "description": "失敗したリクエストの累計。どのモデルで失敗したかまでは分けられないので、全体の件数だけを出す。内訳を追うときはログ（~/Library/Logs/litellm-proxy.log）を見る。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(litellm_deployment_failure_responses_total)",
          "legendFormat": "失敗"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "thresholds": {
          "mode": "absolute",
          "steps": [
            {
              "color": "green",
              "value": null
            },
            {
              "color": "orange",
              "value": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "費用の推移（実モデル別）",
      "description": "実際に応答したモデルごとの費用の推移。別名（main / complex …）とモデルの対応は固定ではないので、この画面だけで対応を決め打ちしない。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (model) (increase(litellm_spend_metric_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "リクエスト数（モデル別・入口別）",
      "description": "モデル別のリクエスト件数が主軸。別名（入口）も重ねてあり、狙った入口だけが伸びていれば振り分けが効いている。速度や費用を比べる前に、まずここで件数を確認する。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (litellm_model_name) (increase(litellm_deployment_success_responses_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "モデル {{litellm_model_name}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (requested_model) (increase(litellm_deployment_success_responses_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "入口 {{requested_model}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "リクエスト数（ハーネス別）",
      "description": "送信元のハーネス（`user_agent`）別。pi 以外を使い始めると系列が増える。ハーネス比較の起点。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "label_replace(label_replace(sum by (user_agent) (increase(litellm_deployment_success_responses_total[$__rate_interval])), \"user_agent\", \"open-webui\", \"user_agent\", \"Python/.* aiohttp/.*\"), \"user_agent\", \"unnamed (no User-Agent header)\", \"user_agent\", \"None\")",
          "legendFormat": "{{user_agent}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "TTFT 平均（モデル別）",
      "description": "最初の文字が出るまでの平均秒数（モデル別）。アラート 3 は全体平均を見ていて、平常の 2 倍かつ 3 秒超で発火する。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (model) (rate(litellm_llm_api_time_to_first_token_metric_sum[$__rate_interval]))\n/\nsum by (model) (rate(litellm_llm_api_time_to_first_token_metric_count[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "TTFT 平均（全体）",
      "description": "モデルをまたいだ全体平均。モデル別を見たあとの補助として、全体が動いたかを確認する。構成比で変わるため単独では判断しない。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(litellm_llm_api_time_to_first_token_metric_sum[$__rate_interval]))\n/\nsum(rate(litellm_llm_api_time_to_first_token_metric_count[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "全体 TTFT"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "失敗率",
      "description": "全リクエストに対する失敗の割合（アラート 2 と同じ基準）。モデル別には出せない（→「失敗の累計」）。件数が少ない時間帯の 1件/1件 を 100% と誤読しないよう、アラート側で下限件数を設けている。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 21
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(litellm_deployment_failure_responses_total[$__rate_interval]))\n/\nclamp_min(sum(rate(litellm_deployment_success_responses_total[$__rate_interval])) + sum(rate(litellm_deployment_failure_responses_total[$__rate_interval])), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "失敗率"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "生成速度（tokens/秒・モデル別）",
      "description": "生成の速さ（モデル別）。TTFT が応答を始めるまでの速さなら、こちらは話し続ける速さ。大きいほど速い（1秒あたりの生成トークン数）。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (litellm_model_name) (rate(litellm_deployment_latency_per_output_token_count[$__rate_interval]))\n/\nclamp_min(sum by (litellm_model_name) (rate(litellm_deployment_latency_per_output_token_sum[$__rate_interval])), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "{{litellm_model_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "トークン消費（モデル別）",
      "description": "入力と出力を別々に表示（モデル別）。費用が上がったとき、入力（長い会話・大きなファイル）と出力（生成）のどちらが増えたかを切り分ける。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 29
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (model) (increase(litellm_input_tokens_metric_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "入力 {{model}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (model) (increase(litellm_output_tokens_metric_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "出力 {{model}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "入力のうちキャッシュ済みの割合（モデル別）",
      "description": "入力のうちキャッシュが効いた割合（モデル別）。計測のずれで 100% を超えることがあるため、単独では判断材料にしない。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 29
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (model) (increase(litellm_input_cached_tokens_metric_total[$__range]))\n/\nclamp_min(sum by (model) (increase(litellm_input_tokens_metric_total[$__range])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "リクエスト総所要（モデル別）",
      "description": "1 リクエストが返るまでの平均秒数（モデル別）。待ち時間も含めた体感の総時間。内訳は下の 3 パネル（API 所要・オーバーヘッド・キュー待ち）で切り分ける。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (model) (rate(litellm_request_total_latency_metric_sum[$__rate_interval]))\n/\nclamp_min(sum by (model) (rate(litellm_request_total_latency_metric_count[$__rate_interval])), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM API 所要（モデル別）",
      "description": "モデル（上流 API）の応答だけにかかった平均秒数。総所要との差が自前スタック側の時間。遅さの原因がモデルか自前かの切り分けに使う。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 37
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (model) (rate(litellm_llm_api_latency_metric_sum[$__rate_interval]))\n/\nclamp_min(sum by (model) (rate(litellm_llm_api_latency_metric_count[$__rate_interval])), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "プロキシのオーバーヘッド（モデル別）",
      "description": "プロキシ自身の処理で足された時間（ミリ秒、他パネルは秒なので注意）。ここが大きければ、遅いのはモデルでなく自前のプロキシ側。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 45
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (litellm_model_name) (rate(litellm_overhead_latency_metric_sum[$__rate_interval]))\n/\nclamp_min(sum by (litellm_model_name) (rate(litellm_overhead_latency_metric_count[$__rate_interval])), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "{{litellm_model_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "キュー待ち時間（モデル別）",
      "description": "処理が始まる前に待った平均秒数（モデル別）。ここが伸びていれば、同時に投げすぎてプロキシがさばき切れていないサイン。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 45
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (model) (rate(litellm_request_queue_time_seconds_sum[$__rate_interval]))\n/\nclamp_min(sum by (model) (rate(litellm_request_queue_time_seconds_count[$__rate_interval])), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "jev（tier の振り分けなど）",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 53
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "tier 振り分けのフォールバック率",
